sequenceDiagram
    participant V as App (Stop, Quit)
    participant C as Client
    participant S as skillm --json

    V->>C: run a command
    C->>S: start (arguments as an array, stdin closed)
    S-->>C: stdout (read to EOF whatever happens)
    V->>C: cancel the command
    C->>S: SIGINT
    alt skillm stops within the grace (60 s)
        S-->>C: envelope, error "cancelled" (with its warnings)
        S-->>C: exit
        C-->>V: cancelled (Home lock released, writes finished)
    else still running after the grace
        C->>S: SIGTERM (skillm dies at once, a write may be cut short)
        S-->>C: exit, no envelope
        C-->>V: cancelled
    end
